== Impact from stats ==
Prioritize Strength, Stamina, and Wisdom based on whether you want to emphasize melee performance, survivability, or spellcasting utility.

= Warder Companion =
The Beastlord’s warder is a permanent pet that fights alongside its master and is a core part of the class’s power in both solo and group play.

